  "text": "```sql\nSELECT\n  p.product_id,\n  p.product_name,\n  SUM(oi.product_price) AS revenue\nFROM \"jaffle_shop\".\"dev\".\"order_items\" AS oi\nJOIN \"jaffle_shop\".\"dev\".\"products\" AS p\n  ON oi.product_id = p.product_id\nGROUP BY p.product_id, p.product_name\nORDER BY revenue DESC\nLIMIT 10\n```",
